      "id": "msg_0204_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi!\n",
        "How’s it going?\r",
        "You’re in the {STRVAR_34 3, 1, 0} group with\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} as leader, right?\r",
        "Would you like to leave that group\n",
        "and join another one? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0204_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi!\n",
        "How’s it going?\r",
        "You’re in the {STRVAR_34 3, 1, 0} group with\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} as leader, right?\r",
        "Would you like to leave that group\n",
        "and make a new one? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0204_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, you! I know it’s a little sudden,\n",
        "but would you like to join a group?\r",
        "If you join a group, you can compete\n",
        "or cooperate with fellow members.\r",
        "It’s a lot of fun. Want to join? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0204_00003",
      "en_US": "Which group would you like to join? {YESNO 0}"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0204_00004",
      "en_US": "Oh. That’s too bad."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0204_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, you want to make a new group?\n",
        "Sure thing!\r",
        "The group you made before will be\n",
        "disbanded, though. Is that OK? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0204_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Cool! What do you want to name\n",
        "your group?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0204_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "The {STRVAR_34 3, 0, 0} group, huh?\n",
        "That’s a great name!\r",
        "The leader is {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\n",
        "I hope the group gets more members."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0204_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "The {STRVAR_34 3, 0, 0} group?\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} is the leader.\f",
        "Will you join this group? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0204_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "OK! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} is now a member\n",
        "of the {STRVAR_34 3, 1, 0} group."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0204_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "When you form or join a new group,\n",
        "be sure to visit any Union Room.\r",
        "Mix your records with group members,\n",
        "and you’ll become integrated.\r",
        "When you’re in the same group,\n",
        "events can happen simultaneously.\r",
        "It makes things a lot more fun\n",
        "playing in a group!\r",
        "Anyone can make a new group, and\n",
        "anyone can join.\r",
        "I hope you recruit lots of friends\n",
        "so everyone can have fun! {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
